    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>噪音警告：本期是周六四个姐妹聚会的录音，主打一个真实，所以真的可能会比较吵</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目主要聊一下四个女生在各自的6-8年在金融圈摸爬滚打的date真实经历还有道听途说的瓜，如有雷同纯属巧合，概不负责~~~当娱乐节目听就好</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎+小助理：juneleilajiao</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起嬉笑怒骂～我们还有超多福利在群内分享喔～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 异国恋相聚A房费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 送假包真的有必要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 消失的精华</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 我有一条祖传的染色体想送给你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">13:46</a> 百变人设取决于女生喜欢什么类型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> sweet的约会细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a> 美女遇到的顶级渣男招数揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1814">30:14</a> 大感动😭男朋友给买包的真实想法居然是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2271">37:51</a> “我只date，不恋爱”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3397">56:37</a> 管你硕士还是博士，我可是男士。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3866">1:04:26</a> &nbsp;毕业回学校参加活动发现大学男友出柜了</span></p><span></span><p><span>好啦！祝你也有美好的一天～！</span></p>]]></description>
